    "about-us-first-title": "About us",
    "about-us-first-p": "Bucharest’s cultural scene is constantly evolving, with cultural initiatives taking place in a wide range of venues — from historical buildings to industrial spaces, socialist-era constructions, and contemporary architecture. Within this eclectic landscape, <b>Filtru Cultural</b> brings together traditional and alternative cultural initiatives, public and private, architectural landmarks and seemingly anonymous buildings that together form the city’s cultural heritage.",
    "about-us-second-p": "<b>Filtru Cultural</b> is an online platform that maps and documents cultural spaces in Bucharest, providing information about their current activities and events. In the <i>Articles</i> section, you can explore in-depth some of Bucharest’s cultural hotspots — not only through the lens of their artistic or institutional work, but also from historical, architectural, and personal perspectives.",
